  titans porco inherits ymir's memories  and understands her history and motives  but he sees nothing from the memories of  his brother four years later he is  present at fort slava in the middle of  marlian mideast war he is commanded by  commander mcgath to wait and be ready to  strike after they destroy anti-titan  artillery as soon as gabby blew up the  artillery porco joins the fight and  destroys most of the enemy forces with  the help of car titan inside the  fortress she destroys several anti-titan  artillery platforms in order to protect  reiner back at marley galliard watches  over reiner as he recovers from his  injuries when reiner awakens he thanks  galliard for saving him in force lava  but galliard coldly tells him that he  only wanted to keep marley from losing  the armor titan during a survey corps  well-organized plan to attack marley a  strange soldier leads porco and peak  into an empty room and captures them  into a hole underground after being  saved by the panzer unit he sneaks up to  aaron's attack titan and leaps onto its  nape but when he tries to bite his nape  he gets cut off by levi he is shocked to  see that the soldiers attacking him are  trying to kill him without any fear he  gets saved by pique and her panzer unit  after seeing that the enemy have the  colossal titan power as well as levi  defeating zeke's beast titan he gets  full of rage and advances towards aaron  after getting both of his legs cut off  by mikasa aaron places crystal inside  his mouth and breaks it taking the  warhammer titan as part of the  retaliation against parody galliard and  pique are sent to infiltrate parodies  military the two infiltrate the military  headquarters where aaron jaeger is  staying once peak has brought aaron to  the roof of the building galliard  transforms into his jaw titan form and  ambushes aaron he helps reiner fight  aaron but they both get smashed by rock  pieces thrown by beast titan galliard  realizes that he is unable to heal all