itan form eventually  managed to sport wings a tail and a  fully feathered body falco and peak are  able to easily decimate the remaining  jaegerists but as soon as they're  defeated falco quickly begins losing  control of his titan he attacks peak and  survey corps members and they are forced  to cut him out of his titan nape after  escaping jageris and arriving in oriha  it is decided that falco and gabby stay  behind with azumabitos and annie after  leaving odiha falco reveals to annie  that he likely received the memory of a  previous beast titan who was capable of  flight and theorizes that he could do  the same due to the unique appearance of  his titan which is presumably because he  ingested zeke's spinal fluid using his  titan falco flies to fort salta with  gabby and annie the three arrived just  in time to save mikasa reiner jean  connie and levi from being devoured by  an army of titans after the group  manages to detonate aaron's nape and  aaron becomes a colossal titan he flies  mikasa and levi to aaron's titan where  the two work together to infiltrate  aaron's mouth and kill him and now  finally the time you've all been waiting  for let's see how some of the ancient  jaw titans look like in chapter 122 we  get to see the first ever nine titan  shifters the first ever jaw titan looks  similar to marcel's jaw titan because of  the long brown hair it had armored masks  covering its face and looked a lot  scarier and more terrifying than both  porco and marcel during the battle of  heaven and earth with the help of ymir  the founder aaron summons all past titan  shifters there we see so many previous  jaw titans but it's only for a short  period of time and we don't get to learn  anything about them for example when  jean and peak try to get to aaron's nape  and destroy it they fight a bunch of  different jaw titans of course we  weren't able to draw all of them but we  have chosen a few that we think are most  unique and interesting two of the jaw  titans that attack peak look absolutely  amazing one of them had a helmet shaped  armor on its head and strong claws as  it's able to slice card titan easily the  second jaw titan is my personal favorite  it's different from every other jaw  titan because it has gold claws and gold  armor on its head honestly this one  looks like a hybrid between jaw and  armor titan so i guess it's possible  that this user possessed both titan  powers simultaneously if you like this  video check out the video about all car  titans in attack on titan

